/Alt (The x-axis measures the time of day in increments of one hour from 1 am to 12 am. The y-axis measures the percentage of trips in increments of 2 percent from 0 to 10. The key indicates the categories of Walk or Bike, Auto, and Transit indicators. Walk or Bike increases from 0 to 6 percent between 4 am and 8 am and reaches its peak of 8 percent between 12 pm and 3 pm before decreasing to 0 percent at 12 am. Auto increases from 0 to 7 percent between 4 am and 7 am and reaches its peak of 8 percent between 3 pm and 5pm before decreasing to 0 percent at 12 am. Transit begins increasing at 3 am and reaches two peaks of 10 percent at 7 am and 5 pm before decreasing to 0 percent at 12 am.)
